// W7-06 U2/t, S-110, S-1177 (§11.5: "状態を持つものを枝に含まなければ E0812（修正候補は `~` を外すこと）"; §2.6: "状態を持つものを枝に含まない `if~` / `match~` の
// E0812 は、`~` を外す修正候補を示す"): an `if~` whose branches are values. The one error has the one candidate, the removal of the `~`, and the
// file with it checks clean (`clean` is about the whole file, so the file has this one error and no other unit with a candidate; §18.1: "当てた後に同じ段か
// 前の段の誤りが残らないとき"). The main position (`at`) is the `~` of the `if~` (the provisional place of the E0812, S-392). One error per flow (P-01).

pub flow value_only(x: F32 at sample) -> F32 at sample {
  if~ x > 0.0 { 1.0 } else { 0.0 }  //~ E0812
}
